<section style="padding:96px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>A leaking oil tank in Moncton is not a wait-until-Monday problem. Heating oil moves fast once it gets loose, and a slow drip that soaks into a basement floor or the soil beside your foundation gets more expensive by the hour. That's why Hub City Tank Co runs a 24/7 emergency line for leaking tanks across Moncton, <a href="/oil-tank-service-dieppe/">Dieppe</a>, <a href="/oil-tank-service-riverview/">Riverview</a>, and the rest of Southeast New Brunswick.</p><p>When you call, we'll help you figure out whether you're looking at a loose fitting, a weeping filter, or a tank that's actively failing. Then we get to your home, contain the leak, and pump out the remaining oil if the tank can't be trusted. If the tank is done, we can usually have a <a href="/oil-tank-replacement-moncton/">new tank installed</a> within a day or two, so you're not left without heat.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Handle</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">What's Included in Every Visit</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">24/7 Emergency Line</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">A real person answers (506) 802-3471 day or night, including weekends and holidays. Leaking tanks don't keep business hours, so neither does our emergency line.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">Phone Triage in Minutes</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">We'll tell you what to check and what to do before we arrive. Often we can tell over the phone whether it's the tank, the filter, or just condensation.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">Fast Spill Containment</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">We arrive with drip trays, absorbent pads, and containment materials to stop oil from spreading. The sooner it's contained, the smaller the cleanup bill.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">Emergency Pump-Outs</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">If your tank is failing, we transfer the remaining oil into safe temporary storage. You don't lose the fuel you've already paid for.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">Help With the Paperwork</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">We photograph the tank, document the damage, and give you a written report you can hand to your insurer. It takes one stressful job off your plate.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">Replacement in 24-48 Hours</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Most emergency replacements are installed within a day or two, and no-heat households go to the front of the line. Every job starts with a free written estimate.</p>
      </div>
</div>
